               ╭ Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
               │                                                                                        │
               │ Ctrl+P            Command palette          m                 Data / messages           │
               │ F5 Ctrl+E         Run statement/selection  p                 Graph / next kind         │
               │ Shift+F5          Run the whole script     o                 Add a row / open a file   │
               │ F7                Explain the statement    x                 Export rows to a file     │
               │ Shift+F7          Explain analyze          >                 Widen column              │
               │ –                 Explain options          s                 Sort by column            │
               │ Ctrl+Space        Suggest names            <                 Narrow column             │
               │ Ctrl+R            Query history            Tab               Next panel                │
               │ Ctrl+N            New query tab            Shift+Tab         Previous panel            │
               │ Ctrl+W            Close query tab          /                 Filter / by cell value    │
               │ Alt+] Ctrl+PgDn   Next query tab           !                 Filter out cell value     │
               │ Alt+[ Ctrl+PgUp   Previous query tab       u                 Remove sort and filter    │
               │ Ctrl+C            Copy / cancel query      R                 Refresh                   │
               │ Ctrl+X            Cut                      n                 New connection            │
               │ Ctrl+V            Paste                    e                 Edit / definition         │
               │ Ctrl+Z            Undo                     Delete d          Delete                    │
               │ Ctrl+Y            Redo                     Ctrl+S            Save                      │
               │ Ctrl+A            Select all               F1                Connection list           │
               │ Shift+←           Select left              Ctrl+B            Explorer / the query      │
               │ Shift+→           Select right             K                 Kubernetes clusters       │
               │ Shift+↑           Select up                Ctrl+T            Next theme                │
               │ Shift+↓           Select down              –                 Classic / new layout      │
               │ Shift+Home        Select to line start     Ctrl+G            Maximize the panel        │
               │ Shift+End         Select to line end       F12               Event log                 │
               │ Alt+Shift+←       Select previous word     Space             Command menu              │
               │ Alt+Shift+→       Select next word         ? F2              Show keys                 │
               │ Ctrl+L            Select the line          Esc               Back / close              │
               │ Ctrl+/ Ctrl+7     Comment lines out or in  q Ctrl+Q          Quit                      │
               │ Alt+Shift+F       Format the statement     Enter             Select / new line         │
               │ Alt+B Alt+←       Previous word            ↑                 Up                        │
               │ Alt+F Alt+→       Next word                ↓                 Down                      │
               │ Backspace         Delete back              ←                 Left / previous column    │
               │ Alt+Backspace     Delete a word            →                 Right / next column       │
               │ y                 Copy as CSV, JSON, …     PgUp              Page up                   │
               │ V                 Select whole rows        PgDn              Page down                 │
